   },
   {
    "id": "p1",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "Taylor Swift released her 12th album, "
     },
     {
      "t": "em",
      "v": "The Life of a Showgirl"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": ", on October 3, 2025. Taylor wrote many of the new songs in the spring and summer of 2024. Back then, she was on tour in Europe. Even though touring was tiring, it gave her lots of energy and new ideas."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p2",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "The cover of "
     },
     {
      "t": "em",
      "v": "The Life of a Showgirl"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " is different from her other albums. It doesn’t show the bright stage lights or a cheering crowd. Instead, Taylor chose a quiet moment off the stage. In the picture, she is lying in a "
     },
     {
      "t": "gloss",
      "v": "bathtub",
      "zh": "浴缸"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " with her stage make-up still on. This is how many of her days ended during the tour."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p3",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "“During my tour, "
     },
     {
      "t": "underline",
      "v": "every night felt like a marathon"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": ",” Taylor said. She faced many challenges and always gave her best performance. But when the show was over and the lights went down, she could not sleep until four in the morning."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p4",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "So, with this new album, Taylor wants to share her true feelings behind the scenes. Beyond the "
     },
     {
      "t": "vocab",
      "v": "lively",
      "ref": "v-lively"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " music and beautiful "
     },
     {
      "t": "gloss",
      "v": "lyrics",
      "zh": "歌词"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": ", she is telling a story about her own life."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "id": "p5",
    "type": "paragraph",
    "content": [
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": "Taylor Swift started as a girl who was always playing the guitar. And now, she is a world-famous "
     },
     {
      "t": "gloss",
      "v": "icon",
      "zh": "偶像"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": " who keeps "
     },
     {
      "t": "vocab",
      "v": "chasing her dreams",
      "ref": "v-chase-dream"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": ". With "
     },
     {
      "t": "em",
      "v": "The Life of a Showgirl"
     },
     {
      "t": "text",
      "v": ", she once again invites us to step into her world."
     }
    ]
   }
  ],
